  "visit": {
    "climbable": null,
    "drive_up": false,
    "trail_note": "Drive about 7 miles up Little Tujunga Canyon Road to Dillon Divide and park near the gate; walk the dirt road (3N32) about four miles to Mendenhall Saddle, then the abandoned road about a mile to the summit. The last section, from the gate at Mendenhall Saddle, is overgrown with a couple of washouts (SummitPost)."
  },
